{"lyrics":"[Instrumental Intro]\n[00:13.48]Mm-mm, mm-mm-mm-mm, mm-mm-mm, uh\n[00:18.96]I can't breathe (Chopsquad), I can't breathe, 999\n[00:23.24]Waiting for the exhale\n[00:31.58]I toss my pain with my wishes in a wishing well\n[00:37.90]I can't breathe, I'm waiting for the exhale\n[00:41.24]Toss my pain with my wishes in a wishing well\n[00:43.98]Still no luck, but oh, well\n[00:47.46]I still try even though I know I'm gon' fail\n[00:51.08]Stress on my shoulders like a anvil\n[00:54.40]Perky got me itching like a anthill\n[00:57.18]Drugs killing me softly, Lauryn Hill\n[01:00.40]Sometimes I don't know how to feel\n[01:03.66]Ring-ring, phone call from depression\n[01:06.64]You used my past and my memories as a weapon\n[01:10.12]On the other line, I talk to addiction, huh\n[01:13.54]Speaking of the devil, all the drugs, I miss thеm\n[01:16.80]This can't be real, is it fiction?\n[01:19.98]Somethin' feels brokе, need to fix it\n[01:23.08]I cry out for help, do they listen?\n[01:26.50]I'ma be alone until it's finished\n[01:29.62]This is the part where I tell you I'm fine, but I'm lying\n[01:33.28]I just don't want you to worry\n[01:36.02]This is the part where I take all my feelings and hide 'em\n[01:39.78]'Cause I don't want nobody to hurt me\n[01:41.98]I can't breathe, I'm waiting for the exhale\n[01:45.22]Toss my pain with my wishes in a wishing well\n[01:47.96]Still no luck, but oh, well\n[01:51.44]I still try even though I know I'm gon' fail\n[01:54.88]It's stress on my shoulders like a anvil\n[01:58.42]Perky got me itching like a anthill\n[02:01.18]Drugs killing me softly, Lauryn Hill\n[02:04.36]Sometimes I don't know how to feel\n[02:07.58]Sometimes I don't know how to feel\n[02:10.84]Let's be for real\n[02:12.52]If it wasn't for the pills, I wouldn't be here\n[02:15.50]But if I keep taking these pills, I won't be here, yeah\n[02:19.76]I just told y'all my secret, yeah\n[02:23.10]It's tearing me to pieces\n[02:26.32]I really think I need them\n[02:30.32]I stopped taking the drugs and now the drugs take me\n[02:33.86]They took the wheel, and then they drove me crazy\n[02:36.46]Got me reminiscin', hyperventilatin'\n[02:39.88]Prescriptions like a doctor, never been a patient\n[02:43.24]Never had the patience for all of this crazy shit\n[02:46.04]I can't breathe, I'm waiting for the exhale\n[02:49.26]Toss my pain with my wishes in a wishing well\n[02:52.00]Still no luck, but oh, well\n[02:55.50]I still try even though I know I'm gon' fail\n[02:58.90]It's stress on my shoulders like a anvil\n[03:02.44]Perky got me itching like a anthill\n[03:05.20]Drugs killing me softly, Lauryn Hill\n[03:08.42]Sometimes I don't know how to feel\n[03:11.46]I can't leave, can't even find an exit\n[03:14.84]Your intentions were to leave me in the past tense\n[03:18.06]And i know it\n[03:19.64]Yeah i read the situation\n[03:21.68]Jump off a cliff, i don’t need a hill\n[03:24.88]This is so fake, could you be for real\n[03:28.16]All girls still on the same shit\n[03:30.72]I can't breathe, her hands round’ my throat she won't leave\n[03:34.42]The devil keeps tempting me\n[03:37.62]Do i give in\n[03:39.88]I know ima sin\n[03:41.60]Here we go again\n[03:43.18]Zanc alot of pain\n[03:44.94]Ima run a check in the wind\n[03:47.70]Never takin L’s all i know is win\n[03:50.88]Startin’ to feel like DJ Khaled\n[03:54.12]Do the drugs, make music, its a balance\n[03:57.72]Then again im losing my balance\n[04:00.50]Percocet givin’ me a new challenge\n[04:03.70]Like how can i climb to the top of this ladder\n[04:07.58]Still no luck, but so what\n[04:10.40]Ima keep on tossin’\n[04:12.94]They took the wheel, and then they drove me crazy\n[04:16.04]Got me reminiscin', hyperventilatin'\n[04:19.08]Prescriptions like a doctor, never been a patient\n[04:22.44]Never had the patience for all of this crazy shit\n[04:25.22]I can't breathe, I'm waiting for the exhale\n[04:28.44]Toss my pain with my wishes in a wishing well\n[04:31.18]Still no luck, but oh, well\n[04:34.66]I